Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:43.22,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030,0035)}{\frz1.378\pos(544,460)}A{\fntangak}lchemistry
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.42,1:11:10.36,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,111)}{\pos(792,526)}Д{\fs55}у{\fs}ш
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:43.22,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.34,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:51.34,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana, Martini
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:53.34,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:47.90,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,20 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.92,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Madam...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.97,memories,,0,0,0,,I must make Do Hwa mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:14.68,memories,,0,0,0,,If she gets pregnant, then the child is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.73,memories,,0,0,0,,Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.40,memories,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:38.79,memories,,0,0,0,,I heard about Do Hwa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:41.00,memories,,0,0,0,,We were just heading there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:45.00,memories,,0,0,0,,Why are you here and not at the funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.75,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm here because this is the only way to change his fate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:09.32,memories,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:37.34,memories,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.43,0:02:39.47,memories,,0,0,0,,I closed his energy gate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:42.77,memories,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:49.36,memories,,0,0,0,,I forbid anyone to open this gate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:54.11,memories,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.24,memories,,0,0,0,,With your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:08.71,memories,,0,0,0,,Why does he control my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.21,memories,,0,0,0,,Still, no one considers him my real father
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:14.17,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll find someone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:16.63,memories,,0,0,0,,Teacher who will reveal my powers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:18.72,memories,,0,0,0,,and teach magic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:21.51,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll find him myself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:25.23,memories,,0,0,0,,And then I will take out this sword and split it in two
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:34.23,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I changed 12 teachers, I was thrown out from everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:39.45,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,And finally I found the one that will change my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I understood everything in our first meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:56.05,general text,,0,0,0,,You are my teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:10.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think there is something special about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:11.61,general text,,0,0,0,,master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:16.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you, the eyes are beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. Only eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:23.03,general text,,0,0,0,,The blue mark of the nomad is imprinted on them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:26.70,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,So the mark is in my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.17,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t be difficult to kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.05,general text,,0,0,0,,But this is Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be caught
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:52.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to save you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.94,general text,,0,0,0,,If you stay with me, you won’t get caught
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:12.12,general text,,0,0,0,,How should you contact me if you want to lay low?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:15.92,general text,,0,0,0,,"Master"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:30.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:31.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, it’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:33.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:38.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:40.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.20,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Moo Deok, my maid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:48.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:54.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, you scared her. Put down your sword
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:05.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:10.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, master
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:13.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:22.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to the chapter. Heard a fight and hid here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.53,0:06:26.32,general text,,0,0,0,,There were mercenaries there, but you can’t fight
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Lucky you weren’t caught
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:30.83,general text,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:33.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Well done for hiding
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.54,general text,,0,0,0,,My maid ran, and I followed her, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:37.88,general text,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:40.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.72,general text,,0,0,0,,And what kind of knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.27,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.40,general text,,0,0,0,,tried to protect him with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:02.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Proud of you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:05.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Correct. Your owner is still a weakling,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:07.53,general text,,0,0,0,,it must be protected
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:10.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:13.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I will protect my master
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:16.50,general text,,0,0,0,,No. No thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:20.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I should protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.34,general text,,0,0,0,,What a grip...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Let go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:36.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey Moo Deok, don't look like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:38.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Look down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:43.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, master
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:47.11,general text,,0,0,0,,So you were the one running away from me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:48.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:50.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for scaring
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:04.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:18.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:22.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, master
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:27.24,general text,,0,0,0,,- Has everything calmed down?\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:28.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone is still in a panic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.03,general text,,0,0,0,,The body of the nomad Nak Su has disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:34.99,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,As I thought, Dan Zhu's people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:37.70,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Now all I have to do is get out of here alive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:40.17,general text,,0,0,0,,What a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Mercenary Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:49.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I always wondered what she looked like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:53.51,voiceover,,0,0,0,,He knows who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:55.85,offscreen,,0,0,0,,We must kill him before leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:03.56,general text,,0,0,0,,They apparently broke the barrier and escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:18.66,general text,,0,0,0,,So the barrier is broken
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:21.08,general text,,0,0,0,,- We are behind them\N- It’s too late
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:25.13,general text,,0,0,0,,The barrier can only be broken using boron
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.00,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a traitor among us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:31.93,general text,,0,0,0,,We must ask the Jin family for help
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:41.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su's body was in the secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:46.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, didn’t you see anything strange while you were hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:47.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:50.65,general text,,0,0,0,,No. I was just watching Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:58.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think Nak Soo’s soul moved into the body of another girl
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:00.16,general text,,0,0,0,,and that’s why she came for her body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Can girls only move into girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:07.67,italics,,0,0,0,,Not really
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:11.34,general text,,0,0,0,,But in order for everything to go smoothly, they choose people like themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:14.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Gender, age and physique. Everything should be the same
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m asking because I haven’t seen her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:21.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Was Nak Su thin and short?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:24.60,general text,,0,0,0,,With a round face like Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.52,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:32.65,general text,,0,0,0,,In that case, her name would not be “Nak Su”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:33.61,italics,,0,0,0,,Look at her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:37.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Which mercenary would look so cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:41.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I think she's a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.62,general text,,0,0,0,,No. She's a human
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:48.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Let’s not speak ill of the deceased, even though she was a murderer
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:56.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho Yeom wants to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:58.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Go without me. He still doesn't like me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:00.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Stay here, it's safer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:01.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:14.82,general text,,0,0,0,,The body was frozen here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:18.70,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no smell of rot, which means your body is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:21.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:24.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I am an assassin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I tried for a long time to understand why you helped me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Zhu sent you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.18,general text,,0,0,0,,No, no one sent me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:47.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Then why did you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:50.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you, but apparently you didn’t get it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.73,memories,,0,0,0,,You have beautiful eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:56.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.28,general text,,0,0,0,,that I fell in love
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:02.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I still don’t see any other reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:07.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I admit, I called you beautiful more than once
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:10.21,general text,,0,0,0,,But only because I pursued my goals
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:12.00,general text,,0,0,0,,And which ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:16.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I was looking for a teacher who would break the spell and teach me magic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:19.22,general text,,0,0,0,,And I found you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Be my master
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:44.24,general text,,0,0,0,,you borrowed the spirit of the Sapsari* of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:44.24,notes,,0,0,0,,*shaggy dog of the South Korean breed, it is believed that these dogs are able to drive out evil spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:45.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:49.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure she’s in Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:50.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:55.25,general text,,0,0,0,,The nomad is hiding somewhere here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Son of Chang Gan from Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.26,general text,,0,0,0,,asks the killer to become a mentor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.68,general text,,0,0,0,,What nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:12.81,general text,,0,0,0,,You will open the gates of your student’s energy and help him master spells
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:16.23,general text,,0,0,0,,As your student, I will help you hide
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:19.65,general text,,0,0,0,,We will have a wonderful relationship that will benefit both of us
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Not interested\N- You don’t want to be my master,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:23.41,general text,,0,0,0,,you can be a wife
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:24.78,general text,,0,0,0,,- Do you agree?\N- Shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:28.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that you went to a bunch of teachers and everyone rejected you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:30.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it because of a lousy character?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:37.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I could not threaten the previous masters, they had no weaknesses
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:42.09,general text,,0,0,0,,But you have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.64,general text,,0,0,0,,You will not be able to leave this place without my help
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.31,general text,,0,0,0,,You will die if they reveal you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:52.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:54.65,general text,,0,0,0,,In this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:13:59.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll just kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.78,general text,,0,0,0,,How merciless. Still, I helped you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:07.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for being merciless, despite your cute face
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:19.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought you to my home with the help of jade jewelry,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:22.05,general text,,0,0,0,,and here it’s even simpler
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.93,general text,,0,0,0,,And look where we are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:34.31,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the secret room of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:38.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Once the doors are closed, they can only be opened from the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.57,general text,,0,0,0,,We are locked here together
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:44.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:48.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Step on the wrong slab and the floor will fall through
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:55.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Kill me and you will be killed by the magicians who come here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:58.96,general text,,0,0,0,,But if you agree, we will leave unharmed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:05.47,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I don’t have the strength to destroy these gates right now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.84,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He will understand everything if I stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:09.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I need my sword
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:12.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I am weakened due to the fact that I migrated to another body
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:15.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I need my sword with energy to unlock your power
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Without it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:20.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.32,general text,,0,0,0,,And to get the sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:25.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to go out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:27.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:30.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Can’t you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:33.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t. We have to wait until they close completely
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You! You lied to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:42.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:44.26,general text,,0,0,0,,- The floor will fail otherwise!\N- Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:48.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight. You'll fall
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:52.47,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where are you pointing your nose?\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:54.27,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey!\N- You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Gad...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:58.73,general text,,0,0,0,,- It hurts!\N- I didn’t do it on purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:00.94,general text,,0,0,0,,- It hurts\N- Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:02.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Let go
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:10.45,general text,,0,0,0,,How will we find your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I know who took it. I'll find him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,It is dangerous to leave Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:18.25,general text,,0,0,0,,We must stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:21.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really need that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Take another energy sword and finish the job
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t. The sword must be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:28.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go out and find him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:32.39,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'll lure him out and then kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You said you were weak
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And I thought you were pretending
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.27,general text,,0,0,0,,How weakened are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Mages are coming
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:48.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Be on the lookout
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:54.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Why? They're on my side
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:58.75,general text,,0,0,0,,On your side? How childish!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking to me so casually?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:01.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, master
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll look at the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:13.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:17.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Moo Deok, his maid
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you hear? My maid
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:24.11,general text,,0,0,0,,You are clearly busy. Go about your business
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:26.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go, Moo Deok\N- You can't leave
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:32.28,general text,,0,0,0,,The head said to gather everyone in the training room
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I am not a student of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:38.37,general text,,0,0,0,,The head wants to gather all living things in that room,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.25,general text,,0,0,0,,what is in this forest
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.34,general text,,0,0,0,,- Uk\N- Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.68,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Why were we gathered here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.85,general text,,0,0,0,,They want to catch Nak Su's people
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:02.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:14.24,italics,,0,0,0,,Some of you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,helped Nak Su's people get here today
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:19.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Chapter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,everyone here knows each other
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:26.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Outwardly, you are all followers of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:30.17,general text,,0,0,0,,So I asked for help
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Jin Cho Young brought Gwiga
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.34,general text,,0,0,0,,You have arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:27.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is Chan Wook here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:29.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:43.16,general text,,0,0,0,,And this is probably Gwigu, a relic of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:44.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.16,general text,,0,0,0,,- Dog?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:48.96,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the spirit of Sapsari that defines magic
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Among Us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:57.01,general text,,0,0,0,,nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:02.56,general text,,0,0,0,,And Gwigu will find him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:05.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Outwardly this is someone we know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:09.31,general text,,0,0,0,,And Gwigu will find someone who has a different soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Close all doors
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.20,italics,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:27.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Anyone who tries to leave this building,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:30.67,general text,,0,0,0,,will be immediately recognized as a traitor and killed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:33.25,italics,,0,0,0,,Begin
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:38.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of souls, a type of magic. But there is one minus
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:40.07,general text,,0,0,0,,A crack is created between soul and body,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.15,0:21:42.57,general text,,0,0,0,,from which evil energy leaks
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:45.03,general text,,0,0,0,,And Gwigu can determine this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.77,0:22:16.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, if I get caught, pretend you don’t know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:21.32,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is your loyalty?\N- My duty
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to become a laughing stock,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.62,0:22:32.58,general text,,0,0,0,,when they find out that I asked for your help
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:34.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Stand next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:39.00,general text,,0,0,0,,No one here will allow this beast to attack me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:11.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Nomad! Catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.12,0:24:43.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that nomads turn to stone when they run wild and lose energy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.29,0:24:44.50,italics,,0,0,0,,It was true
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.07,0:25:15.53,general text,,0,0,0,,We thank you for your help
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.91,0:25:19.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure the day will come when we ask for help
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.33,0:25:24.92,general text,,0,0,0,,All four great families of Deho have gathered here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:27.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard they call you the Four Seasons
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.67,0:25:30.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I see you all together and my soul rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.59,0:25:33.30,general text,,0,0,0,,We used to get together often,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.39,0:25:36.60,general text,,0,0,0,,but this is the first meeting after the dissolution of Wook and Cho Young's engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.10,0:25:39.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Scoundrel...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.06,0:25:42.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I asked for some tea
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.60,0:25:43.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.49,0:25:52.28,general text,,0,0,0,,You were here too
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.99,0:25:55.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you were expelled from Kisan
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.16,0:25:56.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.62,0:26:00.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop watching my every move
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.17,0:26:06.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone was talking about how you were thrown out again
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.17,0:26:07.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I just heard
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:09.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.17,0:26:13.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Our dear guest does not like my company,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.13,0:26:14.51,general text,,0,0,0,,and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.97,0:26:19.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Scoundrel
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.10,0:26:22.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.35,0:26:25.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.45,0:26:39.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, there... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.95,0:26:42.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.50,0:26:46.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Short, with a round face
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.21,0:26:47.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Damn
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.38,0:26:50.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:54.84,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Dan Zhu sent a nomad here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.51,0:26:58.18,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,We need to find Dan Zhu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.31,0:27:11.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Not loyalty, but duty
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:14.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Would you say that in this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.32,0:27:17.74,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm leaving, leaving you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.82,0:27:20.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Initially I was going to lure you out and kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.33,0:27:21.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.08,0:27:23.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinister
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.54,0:27:27.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I am not your faithful round-faced maid Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.13,0:27:31.09,general text,,0,0,0,,You Nak Su. Merciless killer
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.76,0:27:36.51,general text,,0,0,0,,You had the opportunity to kill me in the bathroom
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.59,0:27:38.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I risked my life bringing you here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.05,0:27:42.18,general text,,0,0,0,,It's up to you: kill me anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.26,0:27:45.23,general text,,0,0,0,,or become a mentor, revealing my powers
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.65,0:27:54.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You have a habit of staring at people
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.90,0:27:57.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Continue like this and you will be caught quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.28,0:28:00.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you see the mark from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.87,0:28:02.91,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.83,0:28:06.79,general text,,0,0,0,,And now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.63,0:28:11.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I see because I know
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.05,0:28:14.17,general text,,0,0,0,,And now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.60,0:28:23.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I see clearly
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.39,0:28:26.06,general text,,0,0,0,,But it’s unlikely that you will stand so close to someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.73,0:28:28.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful when kissing someone
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.94,0:28:32.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on, I’ll help you get out
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:35.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Anyone who gets that close will die
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.86,0:28:39.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You may die today
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.61,0:28:41.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Spirit of Sapsari
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.33,0:28:50.79,general text,,0,0,0,,If he attacks you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.87,0:28:52.67,general text,,0,0,0,,will you turn to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.59,0:28:55.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Run
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:28:58.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll try to save you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.76,0:30:23.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu Urn
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.47,0:30:25.59,general text,,0,0,0,,It was our family heirloom
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.89,0:30:29.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:32.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is a family heirloom so fragile?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.06,0:30:34.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.11,0:30:39.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's talk. Here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.53,0:30:41.61,general text,,0,0,0,,UK
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.65,0:30:44.78,general text,,0,0,0,,UK
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.62,0:30:49.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, Uk! Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.54,0:30:55.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.96,0:30:58.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:31:00.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.59,0:31:01.96,italics,,0,0,0,,Bless you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.30,0:31:04.26,italics,,0,0,0,,Uk!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.47,0:31:06.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Collect the fragments
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.59,0:31:08.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll have to put them back together
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.89,0:31:10.18,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes, madam\N- Yes, madam
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.40,0:31:26.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Mommies
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:29.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Your master has done things
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.87,0:31:33.54,voiceover,,0,0,0,,That's how he saved me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.62,0:31:34.71,italics,,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.79,0:31:37.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I broke off my engagement with them last year
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.42,0:31:39.84,general text,,0,0,0,,This time I broke the relic
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.92,0:31:42.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- Engagement?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.38,0:31:45.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Canceled the wedding with her
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.92,0:31:49.47,italics,,0,0,0,,12 teachers refused him, the wedding fell through, now this too
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.55,0:31:51.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Walking disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.77,0:31:55.48,general text,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.39,0:31:57.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.56,0:31:59.48,general text,,0,0,0,,He was dragged away
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.15,0:32:03.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he will face a severe punishment this time
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.91,0:32:13.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I sent you to Kisan
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.49,0:32:16.71,general text,,0,0,0,,They kicked you out of there in six months
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:19.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.37,0:32:22.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that I caused trouble for you, so I came to apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.00,0:32:24.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this your apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.01,0:32:29.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you break the urn?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.97,0:32:32.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I was fascinated by it, I wanted to take a closer look,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.76,0:32:34.93,general text,,0,0,0,,and it slipped out of my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:37.56,general text,,0,0,0,,If I knew the spells, this would not have happened
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.64,0:32:39.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t have enough knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.19,0:32:40.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.44,0:32:44.27,general text,,0,0,0,,He did the same
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.36,0:32:46.53,general text,,0,0,0,,with the door to the secret room. Destroyed it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.03,0:32:50.16,general text,,0,0,0,,He did this on purpose. Out of envy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.95,0:32:54.03,general text,,0,0,0,,This time I won’t let you get away with it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.99,0:32:58.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Until I allow it, Chan Wook is prohibited
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.25,0:33:01.92,general text,,0,0,0,,move or speak
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.25,0:33:04.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Repent
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.77,0:33:24.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.23,0:33:28.11,general text,,0,0,0,,He won’t be punished for long
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.65,0:33:32.16,general text,,0,0,0,,He almost died of a cold after his last punishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.24,0:33:33.37,general text,,0,0,0,,was punished all day
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.28,0:33:37.58,italics,,0,0,0,,His gates of energy are open just enough so that he does not die
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.66,0:33:40.25,general text,,0,0,0,,A terrible cold or heat can kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.04,0:33:42.25,general text,,0,0,0,,And he’s been sick for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:46.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Then open these gates. He wants it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.34,0:33:49.05,general text,,0,0,0,,You are his friends
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.09,0:33:51.97,general text,,0,0,0,,We are too weak
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:54.76,general text,,0,0,0,,But no one in Sosnovy Bor...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.85,0:33:58.47,general text,,0,0,0,,No, no one in Deho would dare do this
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.69,0:34:06.82,general text,,0,0,0,,So he has been punished all his life
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.52,0:34:43.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You can drink hot tea
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.11,0:34:48.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.86,0:34:51.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I will go away and leave you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.36,0:34:54.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.20,0:35:04.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You are faithful and know your responsibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.46,0:35:07.83,general text,,0,0,0,,So you let me in, brought me here
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.92,0:35:11.09,general text,,0,0,0,,and defended
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:15.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You must understand that you cannot tell anyone about this
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:30.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be whole thanks to you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.87,0:35:44.87,general text,,0,0,0,,The people I met wanted me dead
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.16,0:35:48.04,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the first to try
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.42,0:35:51.04,general text,,0,0,0,,save me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.38,0:36:00.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if we find ourselves so close to each other again,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.64,0:36:02.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I will spare you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.28,0:37:02.16,italics,,0,0,0,,I will send a gift to Kisan as an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.24,0:37:06.41,general text,,0,0,0,,and I will pay a decent amount to the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.00,0:37:10.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk made too many mistakes this time
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.96,0:37:13.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I had to punish him
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.75,0:37:15.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you punished him
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.67,0:37:19.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Now that you're done, I'll take it home
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.72,0:37:21.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.60,0:37:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.64,0:37:33.73,general text,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay?\N- Not okay
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.73,0:37:37.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Did Mu Dok come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.53,0:37:40.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does she need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.40,0:37:45.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Speaking of her, where was she when you were punished?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.70,0:37:46.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.08,0:37:52.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you ruin the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The door will not close already
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.29,0:37:57.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.51,0:38:03.01,general text,,0,0,0,,- Why was the ballot box broken?\N- I don’t...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.01,0:38:06.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I said, I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.22,0:38:08.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop asking
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.65,0:38:20.57,general text,,0,0,0,,The firecrackers you asked for
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.65,0:38:22.70,general text,,0,0,0,,They will be visible very far away
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.74,0:38:26.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.87,0:38:30.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do the master need them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.91,0:38:33.29,general text,,0,0,0,,There are rumors that he was severely punished
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.37,0:38:34.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What is he up to this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.88,0:38:37.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Secret
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.75,0:38:40.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell anyone about this
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.34,0:38:43.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Ju Wol
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.47,0:38:47.51,general text,,0,0,0,,He better not interfere anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.27,0:38:55.65,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the amulet of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.23,0:38:58.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you just go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.19,0:39:00.36,general text,,0,0,0,,The young master trusts you greatly
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.11,0:39:03.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Such an expensive thing
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.28,0:39:05.82,general text,,0,0,0,,He wants me to sell him
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.74,0:39:09.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t just sell something like this
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.49,0:39:10.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.04,0:39:13.33,general text,,0,0,0,,He said that there is such a place
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.91,0:39:14.96,general text,,0,0,0,,But there is
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.04,0:39:18.42,general text,,0,0,0,,there is one rich man who buys everything on the black market
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.00,0:39:22.42,general text,,0,0,0,,But getting there won’t be easy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.93,0:39:31.06,general text,,0,0,0,,You will receive a mountain of money
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.14,0:39:33.06,italics,,0,0,0,,Can I have some more chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.14,0:39:35.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll put it on your master's account
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.81,0:39:37.73,italics,,0,0,0,,Eat as much as you like
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.99,0:39:49.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Nak Su's body is here, but the soul is elsewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.16,0:39:54.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You will also be given new bodies by the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.16,0:39:58.54,general text,,0,0,0,,So don’t be afraid to sacrifice yourself for me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.63,0:39:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.94,0:40:20.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.54,0:40:41.04,memories,,0,0,0,,I need my sword
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.13,0:40:43.17,memories,,0,0,0,,I am weakened due to the fact that I migrated to another body
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.88,0:40:46.80,memories,,0,0,0,,I need my sword with energy to unlock your power
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:49.51,memories,,0,0,0,,Even if we find ourselves so close to each other again,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.09,0:40:51.59,memories,,0,0,0,,I will spare you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.39,0:40:58.85,general text,,0,0,0,,- Lost appetite\N{\i1}- Mister
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.06,0:41:02.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr, they were caught
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.44,0:41:06.11,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mu Dok?\N- Why catch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.11,0:41:09.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.32,0:41:11.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu, Deputy Head of Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.11,0:41:13.53,general text,,0,0,0,,caught Nak Su's people who entered Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.16,0:41:15.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.75,0:41:21.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu delivered the bodies to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.71,0:41:23.84,italics,,0,0,0,,We caught Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.92,0:41:26.71,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they'll make us laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.80,0:41:29.80,general text,,0,0,0,,It is true that he did not spare
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.34,0:41:32.01,general text,,0,0,0,,no one?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.09,0:41:33.60,general text,,0,0,0,,He killed everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.10,0:41:37.93,general text,,0,0,0,,We cannot track the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.06,0:41:42.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Ho Kyung from Jinyouwon is also here
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.53,0:41:49.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard, Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.74,0:41:52.53,general text,,0,0,0,,caught the mercenaries that Bor missed
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.36,0:41:56.37,general text,,0,0,0,,How did they break the Pine Forest barrier twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.21,0:42:03.46,general text,,0,0,0,,There was a traitor in the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.54,0:42:06.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, Gwigu caught him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.80,0:42:09.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.17,0:42:11.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I would like to see it too
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.13,0:42:13.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't show it to you now
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.51,0:42:16.35,general text,,0,0,0,,His urn was accidentally broken
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.43,0:42:19.68,general text,,0,0,0,,How could such a stupid mistake be made?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.14,0:42:22.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.44,0:42:27.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Since Jin Mu made such a contribution, I gathered you all to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.69,0:42:29.94,general text,,0,0,0,,that I'm going to assign it to Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.15,0:42:32.40,general text,,0,0,0,,But it’s impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.49,0:42:35.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Gang is still Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.28,0:42:38.28,general text,,0,0,0,,The late king handed him a robe and a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.37,0:42:40.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Jang Gang - Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.83,0:42:43.50,italics,,0,0,0,,Besides, he has a son, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.58,0:42:44.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.25,0:42:46.63,general text,,0,0,0,,hiding behind training,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.71,0:42:48.34,general text,,0,0,0,,has been missing for decades
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.42,0:42:51.46,italics,,0,0,0,,His son Chang Wook is physically unable to cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.55,0:42:53.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu, Gwangju Deputy,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.72,0:42:55.80,general text,,0,0,0,,performs his duties
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.64,0:42:59.93,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, spells related to dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.01,0:43:03.39,italics,,0,0,0,,prohibited among magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.48,0:43:05.60,general text,,0,0,0,,And the magicians of Sosnovy Bor always
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.15,0:43:07.98,general text,,0,0,0,,followed this
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.56,0:43:12.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor could have fallen to the bottom due to the incident with the nomads
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.15,0:43:13.61,general text,,0,0,0,,They could have gotten rid of him
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.24,0:43:19.12,general text,,0,0,0,,But Jin Mu killed every single one
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.24,0:43:22.70,general text,,0,0,0,,In fact, he destroyed everything
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.79,0:43:24.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You are upset,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.25,0:43:28.08,general text,,0,0,0,,because Jeonbugwan got all the glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.17,0:43:30.30,general text,,0,0,0,,The Pine Forest Mages have captured Nak Su!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.38,0:43:32.26,general text,,0,0,0,,But you took credit for this feat
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.59,0:43:36.51,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not what we came to discuss
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.01,0:43:42.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Regarding the Gwangju position, we will call a meeting of magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.77,0:43:45.77,general text,,0,0,0,,and we will make a decision when Chang Gang returns
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.77,0:43:49.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Please reward him differently
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.40,0:43:54.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.61,0:43:58.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you want
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.28,0:44:03.20,general text,,0,0,0,,People are worried about the spell
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.29,0:44:05.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me set fire to Nak Soo's body in front of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.79,0:44:06.96,general text,,0,0,0,,And the sword of Nak Su...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.04,0:44:11.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Let us take him, since they have already managed to lose him in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.80,0:44:16.51,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s what we’ll do
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.73,0:44:29.90,italics,,0,0,0,,The best swords of magicians are kept
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.98,0:44:32.73,general text,,0,0,0,,in the Chongjingak armory
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.86,0:44:36.28,general text,,0,0,0,,But now everything has changed
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.74,0:44:39.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu from Chonbugwan took Nak Soo's sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.99,0:44:43.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, he will bury Nak Soo's body there
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.66,0:44:46.25,general text,,0,0,0,,And she will watch her body burn
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.33,0:44:47.37,italics,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.46,0:44:48.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.12,0:44:51.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you still think that Nak Soo was able to change her body?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.50,0:44:55.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously thinking about asking to be her student?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.17,0:44:57.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.22,0:44:59.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Pour me some more tea
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.55,0:45:05.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You also have hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.56,0:45:07.10,italics,,0,0,0,,lazy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.94,0:45:12.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is your maid Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.86,0:45:17.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find her, but first I need a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.74,0:45:27.33,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Since he got rid of all my things,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.83,0:45:30.41,voiceover,,0,0,0,,he probably thinks that I died, unable to find a new body
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.96,0:45:34.84,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Dan Zhu cannot be found. I don't know who he is
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.47,0:45:46.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Find the merchant who sells this drawn amulet,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.31,0:45:47.72,italics,,0,0,0,,and then you will find me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.31,0:45:49.60,italics,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.33,0:46:13.79,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This is in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.92,0:46:20.42,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.51,0:46:22.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I came for the sword of Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.93,0:46:24.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.30,0:46:27.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that His Majesty allowed him to be kept in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.43,0:46:30.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Gang - Gwangju, I think it would be right to give the sword to his family
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.02,0:46:32.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Since your father is not here,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.35,0:46:34.69,general text,,0,0,0,,it would be more correct for Deputy Gwangju to keep it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.15,0:46:41.74,general text,,0,0,0,,My father is not here, so I, his son, must keep him
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.45,0:46:48.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that you are looking for a teacher everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.62,0:46:51.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I would like to receive you myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:54.71,general text,,0,0,0,,but I cannot go against the will of your father, my teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.38,0:46:59.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did he close the energy gate of his own son?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.50,0:47:02.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand this at all
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.05,0:47:09.47,italics,,0,0,0,,The magician's energy flows through his sword
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.56,0:47:13.64,general text,,0,0,0,,An ordinary person like you will not be able to expose it
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.38,0:47:39.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid that I will succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.09,0:47:44.67,general text,,0,0,0,,If I can, I will be recognized as the next Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.76,0:47:47.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Which means you will not be able to apply for this position
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.06,0:47:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.89,0:47:56.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t do this yet
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.20,0:48:09.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Bye?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.29,0:48:15.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw lights over Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.04,0:48:17.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure he was from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.96,0:48:18.79,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.87,0:48:21.42,general text,,0,0,0,,He was above the valley, the former home of Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.44,0:48:43.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a man with an amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.53,0:48:54.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Madam, they have come
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.12,0:49:00.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I guess someone wants to buy this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.46,0:49:08.30,general text,,0,0,0,,To you in the very last room
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.22,0:49:16.02,general text,,0,0,0,,How could you lose him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.10,0:49:18.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t lose it, someone stole it
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.56,0:49:20.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was Ah Hyang
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.52,0:49:24.52,italics,,0,0,0,,Did you bring this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.03,0:49:29.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to buy the Sacred Amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.11,0:49:31.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You have reached the right person
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.91,0:49:40.71,memories italics,,0,0,0,,It won’t be useful anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.79,0:49:42.63,memories,,0,0,0,,Kill her to avoid problems
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.05,0:49:55.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You know me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.06,0:49:58.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to let me know if anyone brings this drawing
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.93,0:49:59.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I did just that
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.52,0:50:02.73,general text,,0,0,0,,She meets him upstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.60,0:50:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,So it was Ah Hyang
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.11,0:50:12.66,general text,,0,0,0,,We are magicians from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.24,0:50:16.45,italics,,0,0,0,,We just caught a thief. Mind your own business
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.67,0:50:23.83,voiceover,,0,0,0,,He killed her
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.88,0:50:26.42,voiceover,,0,0,0,,He decided it was me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.61,0:50:57.78,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Dan Zhu left me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.14,0:51:27.44,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.15,0:51:34.24,italics,,0,0,0,,- Start\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.55,0:52:03.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Chonbugwan caught Nak Soo, but the magicians of the Pine Forest could not?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.31,0:52:05.68,italics,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor was humiliated
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.77,0:52:09.19,italics,,0,0,0,,There is a deputy in Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.27,0:52:10.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.41,0:52:28.42,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So Dan Zhu is Jin Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.50,0:52:32.17,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy of Royal Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.47,0:52:46.31,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'm burning
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.81,0:52:52.15,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Just like my house and parents burned down that day
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.45,0:53:00.24,memories,,0,0,0,,I will give you strength
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.32,0:53:02.03,memories,,0,0,0,,Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.20,0:53:41.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.36,0:53:44.95,general text,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I can’t do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.74,0:53:47.91,general text,,0,0,0,,just watch my body burn
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.75,0:53:51.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t help you either
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.01,0:54:00.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I found your sword
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.85,0:54:10.18,general text,,0,0,0,,You said you could get your power back if you got your sword
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.19,0:54:20.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you up? Come on, try to bare it
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.17,0:54:40.71,general text,,0,0,0,,The unsurpassed sword recognizes its owner
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.85,0:54:53.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I need to accept his energy
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.14,0:55:32.39,italics,,0,0,0,,You are too weak to bare
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.48,0:55:34.94,italics,,0,0,0,,your own sword
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.31,0:55:39.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You are as powerless as I am
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.15,0:55:41.44,general text,,0,0,0,,We are useless
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.74,0:55:49.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough, forget it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.99,0:55:51.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Go away
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.83,0:56:00.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I doubt that you are a threat to Sosnovy Bor, and Nak Su is already dead
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.00,0:56:04.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Live like Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.01,0:56:10.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.85,0:56:16.27,general text,,0,0,0,,how will I live like this
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.81,0:56:20.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Then die!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.66,0:57:14.62,memories,,0,0,0,,This is the grave of the nomadic soul swallowers
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.70,0:57:18.21,memories italics,,0,0,0,,The one who taught me this spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.29,0:57:20.83,memories italics,,0,0,0,,disposed of bodies here
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.76,0:57:32.89,general text,,0,0,0,,So it will become
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.30,0:57:36.14,general text,,0,0,0,,and my grave too
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.88,0:58:07.59,italics,,0,0,0,,Sir, when can we open this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.96,0:58:10.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm already done
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.97,0:58:12.68,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened to Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.76,0:58:14.43,general text,,0,0,0,,She seems lost
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.64,0:58:19.89,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.81,0:58:23.10,general text,,0,0,0,,She went to Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.86,0:58:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.32,0:58:31.99,memories,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.78,0:58:34.99,memories,,0,0,0,,how will I live like this
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.07,0:58:36.53,memories,,0,0,0,,Then die!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.19,0:59:51.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.28,0:59:53.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.38,1:01:00.84,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Sejukwon, Pine Forest
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.31,1:01:12.77,general text,,0,0,0,,You are in Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.73,1:01:15.53,general text,,0,0,0,,In the hospital of master Ho Yeom in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.65,1:01:19.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I was only allowed in here because of you
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.32,1:01:25.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Do your eyes hurt? I gave you drops
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.58,1:01:29.54,italics,,0,0,0,,He said the blue spots in your eyes are like bruises
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.62,1:01:32.17,general text,,0,0,0,,These drops will lighten their color
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.79,1:01:33.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Drip them constantly
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.76,1:01:43.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I drew my sword
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.14,1:01:46.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I really did it
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.35,1:01:47.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I know, I saw
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.60,1:01:50.39,italics,,0,0,0,,But you are still weak
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.48,1:01:52.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You succeeded only thanks to the energy of the lake
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.11,1:01:56.15,general text,,0,0,0,,My strength returned when I was in the lake
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.78,1:01:59.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to go back there
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.15,1:02:02.61,general text,,0,0,0,,And? Will you live underwater like a fish?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.08,1:02:11.21,italics,,0,0,0,,I felt a surge of energy underwater
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.29,1:02:12.92,italics,,0,0,0,,So I got my power back
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.50,1:02:14.67,general text,,0,0,0,,This is it
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.75,1:02:18.21,general text,,0,0,0,,A man who has the same strong energy as a lake,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.88,1:02:21.63,general text,,0,0,0,,should awaken the energy in me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.72,1:02:24.55,general text,,0,0,0,,And who is this? Will you also look for a teacher?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.22,1:02:28.39,italics,,0,0,0,,Do you think there is someone so strong?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.47,1:02:31.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if there is, will he want to help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.60,1:02:34.27,general text,,0,0,0,,You are Nak Su, a mercenary who wanders from body to body
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.77,1:02:38.69,italics,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.78,1:02:41.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Wook in Sejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.95,1:02:44.11,general text,,0,0,0,,He came to show the wounded maid
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.20,1:02:45.87,general text,,0,0,0,,He broke into us
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.95,1:02:47.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.49,1:02:49.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, I think?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.00,1:02:51.46,general text,,0,0,0,,How badly she was hurt,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.00,1:02:54.92,general text,,0,0,0,,that he had to come here himself?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.06,1:03:13.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I just heard about Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.02,1:03:15.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Really amazing hospital
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.81,1:03:18.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Full of medicinal herbs
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.27,1:03:20.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Like poisonous ones
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.45,1:03:30.20,italics,,0,0,0,,These drops will make your eye color normal
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.29,1:03:31.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Lie down, live like Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.70,1:03:34.21,general text,,0,0,0,,That's all I can do for you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.29,1:03:35.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.75,1:03:39.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I want you to become my Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.71,1:03:45.38,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you risked your life more than once because of me
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.64,1:03:48.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Take another risk
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.81,1:03:56.10,general text,,0,0,0,,This will hurt
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.49,1:04:04.86,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you add here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.20,1:04:09.20,general text,,0,0,0,,One poisonous plant
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.00,1:04:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I bet everything on you
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.88,1:04:22.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you survive
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.31,1:04:40.61,general text,,0,0,0,,If you can,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.94,1:04:45.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I will become your teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.75,1:04:57.37,italics,,0,0,0,,Uk!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.33,1:05:00.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it? Uk
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.46,1:05:01.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.63,1:05:02.92,italics,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.55,1:05:04.67,general text,,0,0,0,,He drank poison
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.38,1:05:07.88,general text,,0,0,0,,- Poison?{\i1}\N- Which one?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.97,1:05:11.51,general text,,0,0,0,,His heart will stop in six hours
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.60,1:05:12.76,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of poison is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.85,1:05:15.27,italics,,0,0,0,,Until you understand and prepare the antidote,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.35,1:05:17.10,general text,,0,0,0,,it will be too late
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.18,1:05:19.73,general text,,0,0,0,,There is only one way to save him
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.81,1:05:21.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Open the gates of his energy
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.23,1:05:24.82,general text,,0,0,0,,and get rid of the poison on your own
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.90,1:05:26.11,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.61,1:05:29.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Open the gates of his energy
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.90,1:05:31.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise he will die
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.16,1:05:36.95,general text,,0,0,0,,July...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.70,1:05:39.46,general text,,0,0,0,,U-uk drank poison
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.29,1:05:41.54,general text,,0,0,0,,They say he will die
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.63,1:05:44.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Mu Dok gave him poison
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.54,1:05:46.92,general text,,0,0,0,,But she doesn’t say which one,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.01,1:05:49.80,general text,,0,0,0,,so her uncle is torturing her now
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.47,1:05:57.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of poison is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.39,1:06:03.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Continue
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.23,1:06:05.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- She may die\N- Uk is dying right now
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.36,1:06:10.03,general text,,0,0,0,,We must find out the name of the poison within two hours
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.45,1:06:17.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.37,1:06:19.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.58,1:06:22.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Open the gate
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.00,1:06:25.88,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the only way
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.34,1:06:29.76,general text,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.38,1:06:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.51,1:06:34.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Please save our master!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.32,1:06:50.78,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mister\N- How is Uk?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.86,1:06:52.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.57,1:06:54.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Masteo Ho Yeom removed the poison
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.12,1:06:56.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chan is safe
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.20,1:06:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,- Has he prepared an antidote?{\i1}\N- No
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.54,1:07:03.62,general text,,0,0,0,,He opened the gates of his energy
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.19,1:07:31.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.12,1:07:46.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Am I alive or dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.29,1:07:49.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You barely survived
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.09,1:07:50.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho Yeom saved you,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.76,1:07:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,opening the gates of energy
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.43,1:07:58.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he open them?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.18,1:07:59.64,general text,,0,0,0,,That crazy Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.35,1:08:03.35,general text,,0,0,0,,didn’t say what poison I gave you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.43,1:08:07.23,general text,,0,0,0,,So he had no other choice
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.32,1:08:13.57,memories,,0,0,0,,I bet everything on you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.19,1:08:17.36,memories,,0,0,0,,I hope you survive
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.37,1:08:21.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.80,1:08:41.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.60,1:08:49.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.41,1:09:01.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.87,1:09:06.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.54,1:09:11.63,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.22,1:09:27.93,general text,,0,0,0,,We both could have died
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.81,1:09:29.94,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.27,1:09:32.61,general text,,0,0,0,,the truth is crazy
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.78,1:09:37.28,general text,,0,0,0,,So you survived,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.03,1:09:40.41,general text,,0,0,0,,my student
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.70,1:09:47.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.87,1:09:51.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I almost died thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.21,1:09:59.97,general text,,0,0,0,,my crazy teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.91,1:11:15.04,preview,,0,0,0,,As a result, Uk opened the gates of his energy
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.12,1:11:18.92,preview,,0,0,0,,Since I survived as promised, I will treat you as my teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.00,1:11:22.59,preview,,0,0,0,,To become the best magician, you must go through several stages
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.67,1:11:25.05,preview,,0,0,0,,You're worse than I imagined
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.13,1:11:26.39,preview,,0,0,0,,We looked at Yulia
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.47,1:11:27.76,preview,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok asked me to come
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.85,1:11:29.51,preview,,0,0,0,,This girl, Moo Dok...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.60,1:11:31.81,preview,,0,0,0,,She seems to be hiding something
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.89,1:11:33.64,preview,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.73,1:11:37.73,preview,,0,0,0,,Mr, the Crown Prince has come to see you
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.81,1:11:40.02,preview,,0,0,0,,There is another sword here that you cannot draw
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.11,1:11:42.44,preview,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t bode well for me if I lose this sword too
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.53,1:11:43.36,preview,,0,0,0,,Nothing to be done
